### Public registration
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.test",
  "password": "a-long-local-demo-password",
  "displayName": "Alex Example"
}

### Login; copy accessToken from the response for the Authorization header below
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "alex@example.test",
  "password": "a-long-local-demo-password"
}

### Create an account (replace token with the login accessToken)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Everyday"
}

### List accounts and copy an account id from the response
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Simulated deposit: use a fresh key for a new logical operation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/deposits
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo.deposit.001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 125.50,
  "category": "SALARY",
  "description": "Simulated opening funds"
}

### Withdrawal; retry with exactly this key and body after an uncertain response
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/withdrawals
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo.withdrawal.001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "accountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "amount": 12.25,
  "category": "FOOD",
  "description": "Lunch"
}

### Transfer; target may belong to another user, but no private recipient data is returned
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/transactions/transfers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Idempotency-Key: demo.transfer.001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sourceAccountId": "{{accountId}}",
  "targetAccountId": "{{recipientAccountId}}",
  "amount": 10.00,
  "category": "OTHER",
  "description": "Shared expense"
}

### History in UTC; lower bound inclusive and upper bound exclusive
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/entries?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z&page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Summary with the same [from,to) time semantics
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/summary?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### CSV statement (maximum 10,000 rows)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/accounts/{{accountId}}/statement.csv?from=2026-01-01T00:00:00Z&to=2027-01-01T00:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
